pxzi"><picture data-rid="5d1a7cf2-046a-4d85-9c58-108957d797e1" class="r-14j6ye7"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/8a734d7d-8e00-4610-914e-30c6f6c7f5fc/81713a7e-26e1-47f2-9ce9-140314122380?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/8a734d7d-8e00-4610-914e-30c6f6c7f5fc/81713a7e-26e1-47f2-9ce9-140314122380?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/8a734d7d-8e00-4610-914e-30c6f6c7f5fc/81713a7e-26e1-47f2-9ce9-140314122380?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/8a734d7d-8e00-4610-914e-30c6f6c7f5fc/81713a7e-26e1-47f2-9ce9-140314122380" alt="Silhouettes of people swimming underwater in blue water." class="r-176ypop" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="a9738f90-3be1-41a1-8a66-efb25b05362b" class="r-169kuq6"><div data-rid="c708fdf9-a474-42e0-bfe8-0da6d13d07e4" class="r-pq4fwt alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-c1a8c56f-d134-48db-bdea-c4ba0a1e6710-styles-606c16be-6e1b-4d50-b471-2c69cced36f7-attributes-color:#000000;--replo-library-c1a8c56f-d134-48db-bdea-c4ba0a1e6710-styles-78e9dc7f-e350-4fa5-ac3d-5f0f41857a0d-attributes-color:#f26729"><span style="width:100%"><p>L-CITRULLINE (4g)</p></span></div><div data-rid="16b211d8-5a7d-40e0-8aec-26d344dff50c" class="r-1d32jn9 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-c1a8c56f-d134-48db-bdea-c4ba0a1e6710-styles-606c16be-6e1b-4d50-b471-2c69cced36f7-attributes-color:#000000"><span style="width:100%"><p>Keeps the engine running when most guys gas out. L-Citrulline boosts nitric oxide to improve blood flow, endurance, and oxygen delivery—so you can push harder, last longer, and recover faster.</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="41dd3fb0-0eb3-4b9a-8251-0a431f4dedea" class="r-1jdf8x2"><picture data-rid="dc12713a-02f0-45cf-9467-553be6bb1e21" class="r-bmrt35"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/8a734d7d-8e00